<title>JAPAN: NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CUP 15-KM CROSS-COUNTRY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CUP 15-KM CROSS-COUNTRY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAKUBA, Japan 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of a World Cup</p>
<p>Nordic skiing men's 15-km pursuit cross-country race on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Silvio Fauner (Italy) one hour six minutes 22.8 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Giorgio Di Centa (Italy)	1:06:42.7</p>
<p>  3. Jari Isometsa (Finland)	 1:06:43.4</p>
<p>  4. Fulvio Valbusa (Italy)	  1:07:22.2</p>
<p>  5. Bjorn Dahlie (Norway)	   1:07:36.2</p>
<p>  6. Kristen Skjeldal (Norway)     1:07:44.0</p>
<p>  7. Erling Jevne (Norway)	   1:07:57.4</p>
<p>  8. Cottrer Pietro Piller (Italy) 1:08:11.9</p>
<p>  9. Rene Sommerfeldt (Germany)    1:08:20.5</p>
<p> 10. Henrik Forsberg (Sweden)	1:08:22.5</p>
<p>Standings after seven races:</p>
<p>1. Dahlie 448 points</p>
<p>2. Valbusa 378</p>
<p>3.  Fauner  338</p>
<p>4. Isometsa  303</p>
<p>5. Mika Myllyla (Finland) 290</p>
<p>6. Jevne 276</p>
<p>7. Skjeldal  250</p>
<p>8. Di Centa   148</p>
<p>9. Sami Repo (Finland) 140</p>
<p>10. Sture Sivertsen (Norway)  110</p>
